window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-094-e27360042a491e3d.json"]={sha256:"e27360042a491e3d3f7656ab940fae58508c3d8f61b2b3af523b5ca596b08e22",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-192556e5aa0a73eb","url":"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning/en/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms","title":"Variational quantum algorithms","titleEn":"Variational quantum algorithms","publisher":"IBM Quantum Learning","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-094","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-094","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-095","referenceUrls":["https://arxiv.org/abs/1912.08854"],"title":"Lie–Trotter 模擬：離散化誤差與閘雜訊取捨","titleEn":"Lie–Trotter simulation: discretization error versus gate noise","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：只有閘約定、目標方向與解析值一致才測大圖；兩位元成功不證明大規模量子優勢。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Test larger graphs only after conventions and analytic values agree; a two-qubit success does not prove large-scale advantage. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"以一階公式的保守界線說明步數增加會同時增加硬體操作。","differenceEn":"Use a first-order bound to show how more time steps also increase hardware operations.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。β=π/8、γ=π/2，單邊權重1，無雜訊。 ⟨C⟩=[1+sin(π/2)sin(π/2)]/2。 代入 (1+sin(4*pi/8)*sin(pi/2))/2，得到 1 expected cut weight。初態|++⟩，C=(1−Z₁Z₂)/2、UC=e^−iγC、UB=e^−iβ(X₁+X₂)，p=1時⟨C⟩=[1+sin(4β)sinγ]/2。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。t=1，交換子範數2，r=10，數值為無因次教學模型。 B誤差=t²×2/(2r)。 代入 1**2*2/(2*10)，得到 0.1 operator-norm error bound。有界Hermitian A、B的實時間一階乘積公式可用t²∥[A,B]∥/(2r)界定算符範數誤差；採ħ=1且哈密頓量單位與t相容。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. β=π/8,γ=π/2,one unit-weight edge and no noise. ⟨C⟩=[1+sin(π/2)sin(π/2)]/2. Substituting (1+sin(4*pi/8)*sin(pi/2))/2 gives 1 expected cut weight. For|++⟩,C=(1−Z1Z2)/2,UC=e^-iγC,UB=e^-iβ(X1+X2),p=1 gives⟨C⟩=[1+sin(4β)sinγ]/2. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Dimensionless teaching inputs:t=1,commutator norm2,r=10. Berror=t²×2/(2r). Substituting 1**2*2/(2*10) gives 0.1 operator-norm error bound. For boundedHermitian A/B, a real-time first-order product formula has the boundt²∥[A,B]∥/(2r); useħ=1 with compatible units. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-004","referenceUrls":["https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning/en/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/running-quantum-circuits"],"title":"Qiskit T1：能量鬆弛與重置等待","titleEn":"Qiskit T1: energy relaxation and reset waiting","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：只有閘約定、目標方向與解析值一致才測大圖；兩位元成功不證明大規模量子優勢。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Test larger graphs only after conventions and analytic values agree; a two-qubit success does not prove large-scale advantage. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"建立『Qiskit T1：能量鬆弛與重置等待』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付半對數衰減圖、平台診斷及重置時間預算。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Qiskit T1: energy relaxation and reset waiting', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver a semilog decay plot, plateau diagnosis and reset-time budget.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。β=π/8、γ=π/2，單邊權重1，無雜訊。 ⟨C⟩=[1+sin(π/2)sin(π/2)]/2。 代入 (1+sin(4*pi/8)*sin(pi/2))/2，得到 1 expected cut weight。初態|++⟩，C=(1−Z₁Z₂)/2、UC=e^−iγC、UB=e^−iβ(X₁+X₂)，p=1時⟨C⟩=[1+sin(4β)sinγ]/2。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：單指數能量鬆弛 P1(t)=exp(−t/T1)；此處假設初態完全激發且熱平衡激發率為零。 使用教學 T1=100 μs、等待t=50 μs；先不加入準備與讀出誤差。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-50/100)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以log(P1)對時間斜率驗證−1/T1；兩點比值應為exp(−0.5)。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. β=π/8,γ=π/2,one unit-weight edge and no noise. ⟨C⟩=[1+sin(π/2)sin(π/2)]/2. Substituting (1+sin(4*pi/8)*sin(pi/2))/2 gives 1 expected cut weight. For|++⟩,C=(1−Z1Z2)/2,UC=e^-iγC,UB=e^-iβ(X1+X2),p=1 gives⟨C⟩=[1+sin(4β)sinγ]/2. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Single-exponential relaxation P1(t)=exp(−t/T1) assumes full initial excitation and zero equilibrium excitation. Use Teaching T1=100 μs and wait t=50 μs; preparation and readout errors are initially excluded. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-50/100) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check slope−1/T1 in log(P1) versus time; the two-point ratio should be exp(−0.5).","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-ddd910c23fc92113","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1912.08854","title":"A Theory of Trotter Error","titleEn":"A Theory of Trotter Error","publisher":"Childs et al. / original research","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-2f38936396021379","url":"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning/en/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/running-quantum-circuits","title":"Running quantum circuits","titleEn":"Running quantum circuits","publisher":"IBM Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
